    <Description>Set your desired hotkey for this macro and infinitly bunny hop. I recocmend to set the hotkey to a key you dont normaly use ingame. make sure that crouch is shift and jump is scroll wheel down. Make sure to practice in shooting range first.
Game resollution: 16:10 ratio, 1920:1200, fullscreen.
Enjoy!
</Description>
